nsider reservation systems during Peak to smooth arrivals and prevent queue spikes.</p>", "+        <div class="rec-metric">Target wait reduction: <strong>{peak_avg_wait - offpeak_avg_wait:.0f} min</strong> per session at bottleneck stations</div>", "       </div>", "       <div class="rec-card">", "         <span class="rec-tag rec-tag-green">Renewable Maximization</span>", "         <h4>Align High-Energy Sessions with High-Renewable Periods</h4>", "-        <p>Sessions with renewable ratio &gt;50% average a reward of {hr_avg_reward:.2f} vs {lr_avg_reward:.2f} for low-renewable sessions. Schedule Bus and Truck sessions (highest energy per session) during Off-Peak Clear-weather windows where renewable penetration is highest. {hr_offpeak_count:,} Off-Peak sessions already benefit from high renewable supply vs {hr_peak_count:,} Peak sessions.</p>", "+        <p>Sessions with renewable ratio &gt;50% average a reward of {hr_avg_reward:.2f} vs {lr_avg_reward:.2f} for low-renewable sessions. Schedule Bus sessions (highest energy per session) during Off-Peak {best_weather}-weather windows where renewable penetration is highest. {hr_offpeak_count:,} Off-Peak sessions already benefit from high renewable supply vs {hr_peak_count:,} Peak sessions.</p>", "         <div class="rec-metric">Green premium: <strong>+{hr_avg_reward - lr_avg_reward:.1f}</strong> reward points for high-renewable sessions</div>", "       </div>", "       <div class="rec-card">", "         <span class="rec-tag rec-tag-price">Pricing Strategy</span>", "-        <h4>Leverage Price–Renewable Inverse Correlation for Dynamic Discounts</h4>", "-        <p>The price–renewable correlation (r = {price_renewable_corr:.3f}) confirms that electricity costs drop when renewable supply is abundant. Implement real-time price discounts during Off-Peak Clear-weather periods to attract price-sensitive drivers. This simultaneously increases utilization during low-stress periods and improves the network's overall renewable energy consumption ratio.</p>", "+        <h4>Leverage Price-Renewable Correlation for Dynamic Discounts</h4>", "+        <p>The price-renewable correlation (r = {price_renewable_corr:.3f}) {"confirms that electricity costs drop when renewable supply is abundant" if price_renewable_corr < -0.1 else "suggests a mild inverse relationship between cost and renewable availability"}. Implement real-time price discounts during Off-Peak {best_weather}-weather periods to attract price-sensitive drivers. This simultaneously increases utilization during low-stress periods and improves the network's overall renewable energy consumption ratio.</p>", "         <div class="rec-metric">Price sensitivity signal: <strong>r = {price_renewable_corr:.2f}</strong> between price and renewable supply</div>", "       </div>", "     </div>"]}, {"oldStart": 902, "oldLines": 15, "newStart": 906, "newLines": 18, "lines": [" # ── Footer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────", " html_content += """", "   <div class="report-footer">", "-    EV Charging Network Performance & Grid Optimization Report &middot; Generated from operational data &middot; All figures derived from source dataset", "+    EV Charging Network Performance &amp; Grid Optimization Report &middot; All figures derived from source dataset &middot; Generated from operational data", "   </div>", " </div>", " ", "-<!-- Chart.js Initialization -->", " <script>", "+"""", "+", "+# ── Chart.js Setup ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────", "+html_content += """", " const C = {", "-  Urban: '#3B82F6', Highway: '#F59E0B', Suburban: '#10B981',", "-  'Off-Peak': '#6366F1', 'Mid-Peak': '#F59E0B', 'Peak': '#EF4444',", "+  Urban: '#3B82F6', Highway: '#F59E0B',", "+  'Off-Peak': '#6366F1', 'Peak': '#EF4444',", "   Low: '#10B981', Medium: '#F59E0B', High: '#EF4444',", " };", " "]}, {"oldStart": 931, "oldLines": 9, "newStart": 938, "newLines": 9, "lines": [" ", " """", " ", "-# ── Inject chart data 